            "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:47:30.713505+00:00",
            "notes": "If things are looking dire, don't worry. Just keep BLASTING! \n(But also keep an eye on teammates out of your range and need your support) \n\n---- \n\nIf you want to min-max your clip before  [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f) runs out, [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) +  [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) work the best for this\n- Spam Guardian Angel to reload your pistol and extend uptime.\n- If you\u2019re dying a lot, **play further back and predict your shots** \u2014 remember, you\u2019re still projectile, but now much faster *(think baby D.Va blaster)*\n- Even if you can't DPS as much as you like, your heals do crazy numbers anyway! \n- If you can't afford those two, just keep building  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and/or  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)",
