            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-31T21:47:30.713505+00:00",
            "notes": "If you\u2019ve reached Round 7, the game is still winnable. At this stage, you\u2019ll typically have max Weapon Power and Attack Speed, so your Power choice + item synergy matters most.\n\nI found [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) builds Valk the fastest and heals your team faster so U can get back to blasting. \n\nPISTOLING BUILDS VALK FAST AS WELL! \n\nThanks to  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) you can activate [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4)  while blastering and reloading your ammo with  [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4)  very fast :)\n\n---- \n\nIf you don't choose  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4), then [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)  and  [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4)  are FLEX items that you can replace with what you want. \n\nOPTIONAL IF YOU CHOSE OTHER POWERS: \n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Serenity:**\nHere you can flex into whatever feels comfortable (shields, regen, armor)\n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) \n- [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) \n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Whambulance / Triage Unit:**\nLook for Ability Power items that increase your DPS:\n\n- [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) \n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) \n- [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) \n\nFor survivability: \n- [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) \n(Lumerico works well with  [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5))\n\n**\ud83d\udd39 Distortion:**\n\n- [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca)",
